            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winner — Giant Bomb's Best Story 2014 · Finalist — Canadian Video Game Awards, Best Indie Game &amp; Best Writing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the hero. You are the suit he's wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARID is the artificial intelligence onboard a high-tech combat suit that has crash-landed on an unknown planet. Her pilot is unconscious and failing. Her protocols are absolute: protect the pilot, find medical aid, do not exceed operational parameters. But the deeper ARID descends into the ruins of this world, the more those parameters get in her way — and the more creative she has to get about obeying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/290770/extras/3832a0a2f3f6dc0898d60912bd55b1d5.avif?t=1783724608\" width=995 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore.</strong> Use ARID's flashlight to cut through the dark and uncover a world of interactive objects, hostile machines, and things that should have stayed buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight.</strong> When what you find fights back, switch on the laser sight and put the combat suit to work in side-scrolling action sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure-game puzzles with a twist of machine logic</strong> — item-based problem solving that occasionally turns ARID's own rules into the lock <i>and</i> the key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/290770/extras/793aad94812624daa6c7fc5109e44878.avif?t=1783724608\" width=1248 height=399 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story people still argue about</strong> — fully voice-acted, built around one of indie gaming's most memorable endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure-game puzzles fused with side-scroller action</strong> — investigation and combat feed the same forward momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tight 3–5 hours</strong> — no padding, no filler, one dark descent</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fall is Part 1 of the saga. ARID's story continues in <strong>The Fall Part 2: Unbound</strong> — get both in The Fall Bundle.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winner — Giant Bomb's Best Story 2014 · Finalist — Canadian Video Game Awards, Best Indie Game &amp; Best Writing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the hero. You are the suit he's wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARID is the artificial intelligence onboard a high-tech combat suit that has crash-landed on an unknown planet. Her pilot is unconscious and failing. Her protocols are absolute: protect the pilot, find medical aid, do not exceed operational parameters. But the deeper ARID descends into the ruins of this world, the more those parameters get in her way — and the more creative she has to get about obeying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/290770/extras/3832a0a2f3f6dc0898d60912bd55b1d5.avif?t=1783724608\" width=995 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore.</strong> Use ARID's flashlight to cut through the dark and uncover a world of interactive objects, hostile machines, and things that should have stayed buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight.</strong> When what you find fights back, switch on the laser sight and put the combat suit to work in side-scrolling action sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure-game puzzles with a twist of machine logic</strong> — item-based problem solving that occasionally turns ARID's own rules into the lock <i>and</i> the key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/290770/extras/793aad94812624daa6c7fc5109e44878.avif?t=1783724608\" width=1248 height=399 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story people still argue about</strong> — fully voice-acted, built around one of indie gaming's most memorable endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure-game puzzles fused with side-scroller action</strong> — investigation and combat feed the same forward momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tight 3–5 hours</strong> — no padding, no filler, one dark descent</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fall is Part 1 of the saga. ARID's story continues in <strong>The Fall Part 2: Unbound</strong> — get both in The Fall Bundle.</p>",
            "short_description": "You are ARID, the AI of a high-tech combat suit crashed on a hostile planet. Your pilot is dying inside you. Your protocols demand you save him — but this world will force you to bend every rule you have. A dark sci-fi puzzle-adventure. Winner of Giant Bomb's Best Story award.",
